# Text files are LF in the repository and in every checkout, Windows included. Tests read
# repo files (docs, markup, styles) and match on "\n"; a CRLF checkout broke two of them on
# windows-latest (docs/platform-notes.md, "Windows CI").
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets, never converted.
*.png binary
*.gif binary
*.jpg binary
*.wav binary
*.mp4 binary
*.mov binary
*.zip binary
*.sqlite binary
